Screen Open 1,640,200,16,Hires

'Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres 

Flash Off : Curs Off : Hide On 

Screen To Front 0 : Screen 0

Load Iff "AMOSPro_Tutorial:iff/Example_resource.iff",0
Set Sprite Buffer 256
Rem Get Sprite Palette 
Get Sprite 1,0,11 To 16,27
Get Sprite 2,0,50 To 16,66
Wait Key 
Cls 
X1=150
Y1=100
Sprite 2,X1,Y1,1
Sprite 4,X1+100,Y1+20,2
Wait Key 
M=Free
Print "Free memory ",M
Save "hd1:gfx/moje_duszki.abk",1
For I=1 To 100
Sprite 2,X1+I,Y1,1
Sprite 4,X1+100,Y1+20+I/2,2

'this is important
'to force hw to wait for Vertical Blank
Wait Vbl 

Next 
